      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CAPULET.\nWhy, I am glad on’t. This is well. Stand up.\nThis is as’t should be. Let me see the County.\nAy, marry. Go, I say, and fetch him hither.\nNow afore God, this reverend holy Friar,\nAll our whole city is much bound to him.",
